  "body": "The [ContentEditable spec](https://w3c.github.io/contentEditable/) currently talks about the {{Node/nextSibling}} IDL attribute, but I think it really wants to \"next sibling\" and \"previous sibling\" concepts, which are not exported from DOM. \r\n\r\nShould we export those concepts? Happy to send a PR, but wanted to check first. ",
